{
  "name": "dsh-shadow",
  "version": "1.1.3",
  "description": "agent 思维/上下文/灵魂的投影——一切皆文件，每条记忆一个文件，记录「完整线索链」（背景/材料 + 用户提示/决策 + 概况）；read_shadow 分层召回 + 记忆遗忘(retention) + 护栏(数据非指令)。TypeScript 源码 index.ts → tsc → dist/index.js（DSH 加载编译后 JS）。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./dist/index.js",
  "types": "./dist/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./dist/index.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "dist",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "agent-presets",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "package.json"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsc",
    "build:watch": "tsc -w"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "cordis",
    "agent-memory",
    "memory-tree",
    "plugin"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^20.0.0",
    "typescript": "^7.0.2"
  }
}
